       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "3.0B1 ships with JavaMail 1.3.3 which doesn't  include javax/mail/util/ByteArrayDataSource. I've updated dev-145636 with JavaMail 1.4.1 and updated the JUnit test as well.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Keeping this open until the fix gets merged to trunk.",
          "type": "text"
         }
