     "body": "<p><span class=\"error\">&#91;Followup from Sourceforge Tracker&#93;</span><br/>\nFollowup Submitter: pangloss<br/>\nLogged In: YES <br/>\nuser_id=487398<br/>\nOriginator: NO</p>\n\n<p>3.0B1 ships with JavaMail 1.3.3 which doesn't  include javax/mail/util/ByteArrayDataSource. I've updated dev-145636 with JavaMail 1.4.1 and updated the JUnit test as well.</p>\n\n<p>Keeping this open until the fix gets merged to trunk.</p>",
